lable by the Head Coach. Attends the contests, when possible, of other teams in the program as determined by the Head Coach. Performs such other duties that are consistent with the nature of the position and that may be requested by the Head Coach. Qualifications Experience coaching and/or participation in the activity. Ability to communicate effectively with all constituencies. Completion of all Minnesota State High School League On-Line Course requirements. To Apply Applications are accepted online by clicking on \"Apply\" above. Candidates are asked to complete the application form. If you require an accommodation to participate in the OSB hiring process, please contact Human Resources at (320) 363-2874. It is the policy of OSB to conduct a pre-employment background check. An offer of employment is contingent upon a successful background check. Order of Saint Benedict is an Equal Opportunity Employer. 000 Employer Order of Saint Benedict (MN) Address 2900 Abbey Plaza Box 2400 Collegeville, Minnesota, 56321 Phone 320-363-2874 Website https://www.csbsju.edu/ Apply"
